WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.992 --> 00:00:01.982
SIMU LIU
It's time to prepare for battle.

00:00:01.982 --> 00:00:02.708
SHANG-CHI
Come on!

00:00:03.380 --> 00:00:05.138
AWKWAFINA
Stretch out those legs.

00:00:05.662 --> 00:00:06.584
SIMU LIU
Leave fear behind.

00:00:06.584 --> 00:00:07.638
KATY
You got this.

00:00:07.638 --> 00:00:09.505
AWKWAFINA
Put on those sparkly shoes.

00:00:10.693 --> 00:00:12.693
SIMU LIU
What battle are you preparing for?

00:00:13.909 --> 00:00:14.862
AWKWAFINA
A dance battle...

00:00:14.862 --> 00:00:16.323
What battle are
you preparing for?

00:00:16.323 --> 00:00:17.730
SIMU LIU
Oh, no, no, no... This is like

00:00:17.730 --> 00:00:19.558
an epic battle
between good and evil.

00:00:22.456 --> 00:00:24.539
AWKWAFINA
Oh, right! Okay, okay...

00:00:24.539 --> 00:00:26.062
So, get your tickets now...

